3. VOICEVOX voice models  (.vvm files — the voices themselves)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    https://github.com/VOICEVOX/voicevox_vvm
    Terms: 「VOICEVOX 音声モデル 利用規約」

    Not redistributed here. Obtaining them means accepting those terms, and the official
    downloader asks for that acceptance interactively on purpose. This project therefore
    does not download them and does not answer that prompt on anyone's behalf.

    bootstrap.py relays an acceptance the operator gives in person: it prints the official
    text, requires the phrase 「同意して取得する」 to be typed at a terminal, then passes that
    answer to the official downloader and records the digest of the text it showed, plus the
    operator and the timestamp, in <core>/.consent.json. The plugin never imports it.

    In summary — the terms permit commercial and non-commercial use and allow embedding
    the models in an application, provided that:

      - audio you publish is credited (for example "VOICEVOX:ずんだもん"), and
      - anyone you pass the models on to is bound by the same conditions.

    They prohibit reverse engineering and publication of the models' internals.

    Read the actual text (models/TERMS.txt in your download) before you rely on any
    summary, including this one.

